{"type":"npc","name":"Wagabago","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":265,"temp":0,"max":265,"details":""},"ac":{"value":34,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"fear-effects","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"holy","value":15,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["chthonian","diabolic","empyrean","requian"],"details":"Telepathy 100 feet, Truespeech"},"level":{"value":13},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Wagabagos prey on people's fear of change. They taunt their victims with illusions that subvert their hopes for the future, making their pasts seem insurmountable and their dreams impossible to attain. Just before their prey succumbs entirely to despair, they switch tactics, inflating those dreams with unrealistic optimism. They repeat this cycle of despair and hope until their targets become paralyzed by their pasts and terrified at the prospect of the slightest change to their lives.</p><p>Three ever-shifting masks adorn a wagabago's black billowy cloak, which hides their many-eyed limbs. When a wagabago peers into a person's memories, their masks project the faces and voices that are most effective at tormenting their victims.</p><h2>No Future</h2><p>Wagabagos choose as victims people with the greatest abilities to enact change: rulers and commanders in positions of power and young adventurers with glorious destinies before them. By neutralizing these potential difference-makers, they seek to stave off future golden ages and keep the world mired in a stagnant present. Some of those unfortunate people stunted by a wagabago's trickery become pruned futures and other temporal paradoxes.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 375/840/1,560 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (slashing), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Deception, Performance, Religion, Society, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, dexterity, energy resistant (vitality), intelligence, mind, mind shield, sensory (darkvision, scent, true seeing), space, space shield, spells (Divine: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.4gBIw4IDrSfFHik4]{Daze}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.4koZzrnMXhhosn0D]{Fear}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.0zU8CPejjQFnhZFI]{Figment}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.O6VQC1Bs4aSYDa6R]{Mask of Terror}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.vLzFcIaSXs7YTIqJ]{Message}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.uqlxMQQeSGWEVjki]{Truesight}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K]{Truespeech}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.yV7Ouzaoe7DHLESI]{Ventriloquism}), throwing, unholy, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"John Arvin Baygan","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":8},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":8}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":24,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"truesight","acuity":"precise","range":60}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":23,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":25,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":27},"athletics":{"base":24},"deception":{"base":27},"performance":{"base":25},"religion":{"base":24},"society":{"base":25},"stealth":{"base":27}},"traits":{"value":["fiend","sahkil","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"8xbTrq6MiN8tPh5z","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/wagabago.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Wagabago","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/wagabago.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/wagabago.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"constant-spells","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kakyXBG5WA8c6Zfd","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"cMlfsRhDBJq34Iag"},{"name":"Divine Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":25,"dc":33},"tradition":{"value":"divine"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"xqlqJ6eeiNtWb7bq","img":"icons/commodities/treasure/mask-wood-tan.webp","name":"Mask of Terror (Self Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target appears to be a gruesome and terrifying creature. The effect is unique to each observer, so a human viewing the target might see a demon with bloody fangs, but a demon observing the target might see a glowing angelic visage.</p>\n<p>When any creature attempts a hostile action against the target, the creature must attempt a Will save. It is then temporarily immune until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} before using its action.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}, and its action fails and is wasted.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You can target up to 5 creatures. If a creature uses a hostile action or reaction that affects multiple targets simultaneously, it needs to attempt only one save against <em>mask of terror</em>.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mask-of-terror","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","fear","illusion","manipulate","mental","visual"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky","heightenedLevel":7},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.O6VQC1Bs4aSYDa6R","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"2ymtAzgE7ehdxjmi"},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/fear.webp","name":"Fear","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to five creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"fear","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","fear","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"5 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4koZzrnMXhhosn0D","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"C9FXzYplbxVyOlil"},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"icons/magic/control/control-influence-puppet.webp","name":"Ventriloquism (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Whenever you speak or make any other sound vocally, you can make your vocalization seem to originate from somewhere else within 60 feet, and you can change that apparent location freely as you vocalize. Any creature that hears the sound can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The spell's duration increases to 1 hour, and you can also change the tone, quality, and other aspects of your voice. Before a creature can attempt to disbelieve your illusion, it must actively attempt a Perception check or otherwise use actions to interact with the sound.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ventriloquism","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","illusion","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yV7Ouzaoe7DHLESI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"neKpEsJ9dR9h8CBu"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/daze.webp","name":"Daze","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"daze","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","mental","nonlethal"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 round","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"mental"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":2,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4gBIw4IDrSfFHik4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"prJyVjudehHBWxRt"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/ghost-sound.webp","name":"Figment","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a simple illusory sound or vision. A sound adds the auditory trait to the spell and the sound can't include intelligible words or elaborate music. A vision adds the visual trait, can be no larger than a 5-foot cube, and is clearly crude and undetailed if viewed from within 15 feet. When you Cast or Sustain the Spell, you can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.GkmbTGfg8KcgynOA]{Create a Diversion} with the illusion, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to your Deception check. If the attempt fails against a creature, that creature disbelieves the <em>figment</em>.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.2Hg3a06gZCSnUgSA]{Spell Effect: Figment}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"figment","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","illusion","manipulate","subtle"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.0zU8CPejjQFnhZFI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"BN35Xp4CShlj8MSb"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/message.webp","name":"Message","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You mouth words quietly, but instead of coming out of your mouth, they're transferred directly to the ears of the target. While others can't hear your words any better than if you normally mouthed them, the target can hear your words as if they were standing next to you. The target can give a brief response as a reaction, or as a free action on their next turn if they wish, but they must be able to see you and be within range to do so. If they respond, their response is delivered directly to your ear, just like the original message.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The spell's range increases to 500 feet.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"message","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","cantrip","concentrate","illusion","linguistic","mental","subtle"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"see below","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"range":{"value":"500 feet"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.vLzFcIaSXs7YTIqJ","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"EoNuhrJ1qg6ZV2bL"},{"folder":"zDlxATrLAlbYA2Mv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/true-seeing.webp","name":"Truesight (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You see things within 60 feet as they actually are. The GM rolls a secret counteract check against any illusion, morph or polymorph effect in the area, but only for the purpose of determining whether you see through it (for instance, if the check succeeds against a polymorph spell, you can see the creature's true form, but you don't end the polymorph spell).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"truesight","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","revelation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":true},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.uqlxMQQeSGWEVjki","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"r6tBBBJ709Z9hlMr"},{"folder":"iDjm2cXyRAe4VZ35","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tongues.webp","name":"Truespeech (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"truespeech","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"vmKMutnvx1IwNAky","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"W32C2TVchupvjZSr"},{"type":"action","name":"Phantasmal Tormentor","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day for each mask</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The wagabago activates one of their three masks, causing it to fly off their face and spin an illusory body that mimics a Medium creature. This functions as a 6th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.f8SBoXiXQjlCKqly], except that creatures who disbelieve the illusion do not recover any damage taken and continue to take full damage from the illusion. Additionally, the illusion can use a special ability based on its mask.</p><ul><li><strong>Trauma</strong> The illusion takes on the form of a long-buried memory.</li><li><strong>Persecution</strong> The illusion takes on the form of an authority figure that abuses their power.</li><li><strong>Temptation</strong> The illusion takes on the form of a person who promises hope, redemption, power, or pleasure.</li></ul>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false,"frequency":{"max":3,"per":"day"}},"effects":[],"_id":"2q1ct4VIuhPuF1k3","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Walk the Ethereal Line","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The wagabago slides off the Ethereal Plane to walk the thin line between the Ethereal Plane and the Universe, existing on both planes simultaneously. They can spend one action to exit this boundary; if they do, they only exist on the Ethereal Plane.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","teleportation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"dVNTCjcX9Nl0pvEt","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Lingering Terror","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Creatur